# Validate with:  pip install cffconvert && cffconvert --validate
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or these data, please cite the article given under
  preferred-citation, and the repository itself using the metadata below.
type: software
title: >-
  Code and data for: Deep learning identification and counting of migratory salmon and
  trout from fishway video: validation against six years of counts at two Lake Ontario
  tributaries
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, model configuration, training-run provenance and the derived count tables
  needed to reproduce the classification score, the count-agreement statistics and the
  figures of the accompanying article. A single DEIMv2-X detector with a DINOv3 backbone
  identifies five salmon and trout species in RiverWatcher fishway video; BoT-SORT tracking
  converts detections into daily upstream and downstream counts, which are validated against
  technician counts at the Ganaraska River and the Credit River, 2020 to 2025.
authors:
